{"id":"n79633-1-8","stage":4,"title":"초월 · 超越","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79633-1-8-1","ko":"이 노래 좀 들어 봐. 진짜 파격적이지?","zh":"听听这首歌吧。真的非常大胆创新，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"1","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파격적이지?","meaning":"破格，破格的","explanation":"파격적：破格，破格的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"파격적","audio":"/audio/abdaf8e418d65323764a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82691","senseId":"1","lemma":"파격적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","